@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Alles ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients

### Eén ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/1

### Aanmaken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Frank Herbert","
  "address": "Frank Herbert",
  "city": "Frank Herbert",
  "zipCode": "Frank Herbert",
  "province": "Frank Herbert",
  "country": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "Frank herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Aanmaken without a field
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Frank Herbert",
  "city": "Frank Herbert",
  "zipCode": "Frank Herbert",
  "province": "Frank Herbert",
  "country": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactName": "Frank Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "Frank herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Bestaat niet -> verwacht 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "asd",
  "address": "qwd Herbert",
  "city": "qwe Herbert",
  "zipCode": "dwq Herbert",
  "province": "dwq Herbert",
  "country": "qwe Herbert",
  "contactName": "dwq Herbert",
  "contactEmail": "e herbert",
  "contactPhone": "123412321"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/1

### Bestaat niet → verwacht 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/999


